2026-09-24T01:31:04.2873798Z 
2026-09-24T01:31:04.2874027Z A blocked or observed runtime action is not proof that the final software works.
2026-09-24T01:31:04.2874865Z DiffWitness verifies the resulting Git change independently. Source code and raw prompts/diffs stay local by default.
2026-09-24T01:31:04.2875316Z 
2026-09-24T01:31:04.2875549Z For every command and advanced workflow: `dw view technical`, then `dw --help`.
2026-09-24T01:31:04.2875858Z 
2026-09-24T01:31:04.2876322Z Language: English by default. Save with `dw language en|fr`; override once with `dw --language en|fr <command>`. OS locale never selects product language.
